{"4456110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planet No More", "steam_appid": 4456110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet No More</strong> is an immersive arcade-incremental experience where you pulverize celestials with your fleet. Your devastating shots dynamically shatter your target right before your eyes, scattering valuable materials into the void of space. Collect this loot before your fuel runs out, upgrade your weapons and fleet, and advance further across the galaxy! To unlock your next target, you will need to destroy each celestial down to its very core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Celestial Escalation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely demolish celestial bodies to earn rare “Celestial Core” which are the currency required to unlock the next body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic 3D Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the visual satisfaction of rotating 3D planets that realistically shatter and erode as you bombard them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/050c5973ce30566d3f5251a485f62a87.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/050c5973ce30566d3f5251a485f62a87.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/050c5973ce30566d3f5251a485f62a87.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expansive Meta-Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest your earnings into a deep upgrade tree to enhance your firepower, fuel and resource collection efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/c0b56140acb856ad32451bf7e835e83b.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/c0b56140acb856ad32451bf7e835e83b.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/c0b56140acb856ad32451bf7e835e83b.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactile Resource Scavenging</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actively collect scattered resources with your cursor, using upgradable magnet mechanics to sweep up cosmic riches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/e595705c415d3688878497a86639a3de.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/e595705c415d3688878497a86639a3de.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/e595705c415d3688878497a86639a3de.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Cosmic Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats for a short period of time by collecting passing comets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fuel Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against a depleting fuel bar and optimize your run time by balancing raw power with fuel-efficiency upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet No More</strong> is an immersive arcade-incremental experience where you pulverize celestials with your fleet. Your devastating shots dynamically shatter your target right before your eyes, scattering valuable materials into the void of space. Collect this loot before your fuel runs out, upgrade your weapons and fleet, and advance further across the galaxy! To unlock your next target, you will need to destroy each celestial down to its very core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Celestial Escalation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely demolish celestial bodies to earn rare “Celestial Core” which are the currency required to unlock the next body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/6e3dcefa470d5f8da81322f4bae99541.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic 3D Destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the visual satisfaction of rotating 3D planets that realistically shatter and erode as you bombard them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/050c5973ce30566d3f5251a485f62a87.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><sourc