kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/e595705c415d3688878497a86639a3de.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Cosmic Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your stats for a short period of time by collecting passing comets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/ce374e917d0c8469057a6a481a44e783.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fuel Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against a depleting fuel bar and optimize your run time by balancing raw power with fuel-efficiency upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.poster.avif?t=1787722834\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.webm?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/extras/96640d6e5b71e6259d7919438c71a431.mp4?t=1787722834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An arcade-incremental game where you DESTROY planets! Build a fleet, upgrade weapons, max out your skill tree and destroy your target slowly. You'll advance deep into the galaxy, strategically shattering planets to their cores to unlock the next celestial.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/6cfb09da963ce06d32f8b46bd0b5febda95e6685/header.jpg?t=1787722834", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/7b83e55becb0660d1304f8fc6f1a0f328f71c411/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787722834", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4456110/7b83e55becb0660d1304f8fc6f1a0f328f71c411/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787722834", "website": "https://www.wisemonkees.com/gamepages/pnm.html", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor: